# Spot's room: pet, feed, a round of fetch.
Output docs/room.gif
Set Shell zsh
Set FontSize 18
Set Width 1200
Set Height 760
Set Padding 24
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Hide
Type "source docs/tapes/env.sh" Enter
Sleep 4s
Show
Type "spot" Enter
Sleep 2.5s
Screenshot docs/shot-room.png
Type "p"
Sleep 900ms
Screenshot docs/shot-pet.png
Sleep 2s
Type "f"
Sleep 3s
Type "b"
Sleep 1450ms
Space
Sleep 1.5s
Screenshot docs/shot-fetch.png
Sleep 6s
Escape
Sleep 2s
Type "q"
Sleep 500ms
